Details are in the log folder.

Remove {0} from the list?
{1}

The folder stays on disk; delete it yourself if you don't need it any more.

Move {0} mods ({1}) that no profile uses to the mod library?

{2}

The game doesn't see mods there, so it starts faster and its mod list is shorter. When you add one of them to a profile in Dispatch, it's moved back by itself. Nothing is copied or deleted, and you can move them back at any time.
